    example, we can instead clip to the last valid value:

    >>> jnp.take(x, indices, axis=0, mode='clip')
    Array([[4., 5., 6.],
           [1., 2., 3.]], dtype=float32)
    >>> x.at[indices].get(mode='clip')  # equivalent indexing syntax
    Array([[4., 5., 6.],
           [1., 2., 3.]], dtype=float32)

